# Testing

- Feature tests use SQLite in memory. Keep `phpunit.xml` `<server>` DB overrides so Compose env cannot wipe Postgres.
- Mock PokéAPI with `Http::fake` + fixtures. No live upstream calls in CI/tests.
- Cover import idempotency, image mapping/fallback, locale negotiation, validation errors, 404s.
- Never weaken assertions to force green builds.
